How is the --limit option used?
===============================

Action Flag	Honors --limit	Behavior
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
--list	        Yes	        Filters exported hosts across JSON, YAML,
                                and TOML formats.

--host <name>	No	        Bypasses the subset filter to query the exact
                                target host directly via self.inventory.get_hosts(context.CLIARGS['host']).

--graph	        No	        Traverses static group definitions recursively
                                (group.hosts) rather than the active filtered
				list.
